    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/49799e2552135118441c98f851a65d90.avif?t=1743455942\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WELCOME CHRONONAUT!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the Gap</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure building game</strong> supporting up to 4 players. You will travel through time and face challenges requiring creative solutions. Equipped with an all-in-one Multitool, you can build simple or intricate designs! Throughout your adventure, you will meet many colorful characters and explore detailed worlds. It's time to start your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=800 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Journey through time to visit various open-world locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan and build functional machines to complete challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=788 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Converse with characters in a dynamic, lived-in world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=798 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Travel solo or as a group of up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/49799e2552135118441c98f851a65d90.avif?t=1743455942\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WELCOME CHRONONAUT!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across the Gap</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure building game</strong> supporting up to 4 players. You will travel through time and face challenges requiring creative solutions. Equipped with an all-in-one Multitool, you can build simple or intricate designs! Throughout your adventure, you will meet many colorful characters and explore detailed worlds. It's time to start your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=800 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/be4b8866367cc16fbeca10357e22af7a.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Journey through time to visit various open-world locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/127cc92a133b80e9742a389bda679ec2.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan and build functional machines to complete challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=788 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/18298562b66e227df729b31c104bf162.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Converse with characters in a dynamic, lived-in world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.poster.avif?t=1743455942\" width=798 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.webm?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/edcb13528812bf06ce9219ff167dc12a.mp4?t=1743455942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Travel solo or as a group of up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
